{"name":"Thumb pulling","deep":true,"image":null,"mentions":13,"casual":{"lead":["Thumb pulling is a looksmaxxing practice in which a person places a thumb on the roof of the mouth and pulls downward and forward, intending to widen or move the upper jaw. It is presented in forums as a do-it-yourself imitation of the palate expanders used in orthodontics.","Proponents report easier breathing, a feeling of movement in the maxilla and a larger palate. Other forum users call it ineffective, and no published study has tested it."],"sections":[{"h":"How it works","paras":["The idea is that sustained mechanical force on the palate remodels bone, as in orthodontic expansion. Orthodontic expansion uses fixed appliances that apply controlled force over weeks, and in teenagers and adults the midpalatal suture is generally less open or fused, which is why implant-assisted or surgical expansion is used. Forum users themselves question whether a thumb can produce enough force for long enough."],"subs":[]},{"h":"Risks and caveats","paras":["No clinical safety data exist. Orthodontic literature on expansion lists side effects such as a gap between the upper front teeth, pain and bone thinning, but those concern appliances. Forum posts describe diastema after combining thumb pulling with hard mewing and expanders."],"subs":[]}]},"gallery":[],"links":{"studies":[{"title":"Dispenser for confectionery products in semi-solid state","url":"https://europepmc.org/article/PAT/EP1206910","source":null,"year":2002,"cites":0,"kind":null}],"trials":[],"label":null,"reddit":[],"forums":[{"title":"Thumb pulling update","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/thumb-pulling-update.1474237/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20250812125235/https://looksmax.org/threads/thumb-pulling-update.1474237/"},{"title":"Thumb Pulling Works Or is it bs?","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/thumb-pulling-works-or-is-it-bs.1410346/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20250613223001/https://looksmax.org/threads/thumb-pulling-works-or-is-it-bs.1410346/"},{"title":"Thumb pulling","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/thumb-pulling.1230164/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20241204032446/https://looksmax.org/threads/thumb-pulling.1230164/"},{"title":"thumb pulling slight underbite","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/thumb-pulling-slight-underbite.1140845/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20250523165031/https://looksmax.org/threads/thumb-pulling-slight-underbite.1140845/"},{"title":"thumb pulling and maxilla growth","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/thumb-pulling-and-maxilla-growth.938667/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20240214041149/https://looksmax.org/threads/thumb-pulling-and-maxilla-growth.938667/"},{"title":"thumb pulling","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/thumb-pulling.590742/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20221023124940/https://looksmax.org/threads/thumb-pulling.590742/"},{"title":"my normie friend asked me about thumb pulling","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/my-normie-friend-asked-me-about-thumb-pulling.1395637/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20250522002229/https://looksmax.org/threads/my-normie-friend-asked-me-about-thumb-pulling.1395637/"},{"title":"where do i put my thumb in the palate during thumb pulling","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/where-do-i-put-my-thumb-in-the-palate-during-thumb-pulling.1226951/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20241214130752/https://looksmax.org/threads/where-do-i-put-my-thumb-in-the-palate-during-thumb-pulling.1226951/"},{"title":"underbite thumb pulling","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/underbite-thumb-pulling.1198054/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20250525081542/https://looksmax.org/threads/underbite-thumb-pulling.1198054/"},{"title":"3 months thumb pulling no progress","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/3-months-thumb-pulling-no-progress.617073/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20221207220659/https://looksmax.org/threads/3-months-thumb-pulling-no-progress.617073/"},{"title":"can a facepuller do mewing thumb pulling for me","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/can-a-facepuller-do-mewing-thumb-pulling-for-me.593251/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20221028052055/https://looksmax.org/threads/can-a-facepuller-do-mewing-thumb-pulling-for-me.593251/"},{"title":"nose getting straighter from chewing and thumb pulling pictures provided","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/nose-getting-straighter-from-chewing-and-thumb-pulling-pictures-provided.529814/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20220712012934/https://looksmax.org/threads/nose-getting-straighter-from-chewing-and-thumb-pulling-pictures-provided.529814/"},{"title":"face pulling and thumb pulling to pull the maxilla forward","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/face-pulling-and-thumb-pulling-to-pull-the-maxilla-forward.53314/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20220814235905/https://looksmax.org/threads/face-pulling-and-thumb-pulling-to-pull-the-maxilla-forward.53314/"},{"title":"Simo - The Red Shoe Diaries (Part 1)","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/simo-the-red-shoe-diaries-part-1/228734","site":"T Nation · 10000 posts · 2017"},{"title":"Per aspera ad astra (strongman Koestrizer)","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/per-aspera-ad-astra-strongman-koestrizer/213205","site":"T Nation · 8404 posts · 2015"},{"title":"GuineaPig’s Training Log - Hunt 300 Deadlift","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/guineapig-s-training-log-hunt-300-deadlift/235959","site":"T Nation · 6370 posts · 2017"},{"title":"The Tactical Life","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/the-tactical-life/232312","site":"T Nation · 5251 posts · 2017"},{"title":"Rise Of The Slaya 2019- Next Strongman Comp prep and fixing my hip","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/rise-of-the-slaya-2019-next-strongman-comp-prep-and-fixing-my-hip/238440","site":"T Nation · 5084 posts · 2018"},{"title":"The Return of Even More Movies You've Watched This Week III","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/the-return-of-even-more-movies-youve-watched-this-week-iii/210398","site":"T Nation · 4744 posts · 2015"},{"title":"Boilerman Wants It All","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/boilerman-wants-it-all/254882","site":"T Nation · 4422 posts · 2019"},{"title":"Dani's Rebel Log","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/danis-rebel-log/280747","site":"T Nation · 3979 posts · 2023"},{"title":"Clockin' A Grip","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/clockin-a-grip/215284","site":"T Nation · 3802 posts · 2016"},{"title":"Atlas13 Burning the Boats","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/atlas13-burning-the-boats/259312","site":"T Nation · 3714 posts · 2019"},{"title":"Antiquity's Tactical Barbell 3 log","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/antiquitys-tactical-barbell-3-log/271188","site":"T Nation · 2826 posts · 2020"},{"title":"Until the Wheels Fall Off","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/until-the-wheels-fall-off/162674","site":"T Nation · 2654 posts · 2015"},{"title":"Persistent Guy's Training Log Continues","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/persistent-guys-training-log-continues/194684","site":"T Nation · 2592 posts · 2013"},{"title":"Dchris's Grappling with Age","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/dchriss-grappling-with-age/224841","site":"T Nation · 2559 posts · 2016"},{"title":"Magick's Training Log v2","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/magicks-training-log-v2/226628","site":"T Nation · 2177 posts · 2017"}],"web":[{"title":"Palatal expansion (Wikipedia)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Palatal_expansion"}]},"wikipedia":null,"grokipedia":null,"lead":["Thumb pulling is a practice in looksmaxxing communities in which a person pulls on the palate with the thumb, usually downward and forward, in the belief that it can widen the palate or move the maxilla forward [1][2]. It is discussed as a free alternative to professional palatal expansion and is commonly paired with mewing and chewing.","No published study has tested thumb pulling. Professional palatal expansion, by contrast, is an established orthodontic procedure that uses appliances, usually in children and adolescents, because the midpalatal suture is open early in life and generally fuses after puberty [3]."],"infobox":[["Type","Manual palate-pulling practice"],["Also called","Thumbpulling, palate expansion by thumb"],["Compared to","Orthodontic palatal expansion (appliance-based)"],["Commonly paired with","Mewing, chewing, chin tucks"],["Evidence level","Unproven"]],"sections":[{"h":"Description","paras":["Forum threads describe placing a thumb against the palate and pulling, with questions about exactly where on the palate to place the thumb [4]. Related threads discuss thumb pulling for underbites and maxilla growth, and whether a second person could do the pulling [5][6][7]."],"subs":[]},{"h":"Comparison with orthodontic expansion","paras":["Rapid palatal expansion uses a device the patient turns to widen the palate roughly 0.5 to 1 mm per day, typically left in for three to six months, and is mostly done in children and adolescents aged about 8 to 18 [3]. In adults the suture generally requires surgery or implant assistance, and side effects include speech changes, pain, tongue sores and a gap between the upper front teeth [3]. Treatment after the growth spurt is described as mainly moving teeth rather than changing bone [3]."],"subs":[]},{"h":"Clinical studies","paras":["No studies found. No published trial or case series has tested thumb pulling. Research on palatal expansion concerns orthodontic appliances, not manual pulling [3]."],"subs":[]},{"h":"In looksmaxxing culture","paras":["On looksmax.org, one user said that after being told the method was 'cope' with no results, he saw a change after a week of twice-daily thumb pulling with hard mewing, reporting a larger palate on one side and easier breathing [1]. Another asked whether it works and said they could breathe better after two weeks, while a reply said thumb pulling works in theory but that a thumb cannot generate enough force for long enough, calling it a diluted version of an expander [2]. A third thread's replies suggest it is useless after about age 15 to 16, while a 17-year-old described feeling something in the maxilla [8]. Other threads report no progress after three months [9], a gap between the front teeth after expansion combined with thumb pulling, and straighter noses attributed to chewing and thumb pulling [10]."],"subs":[]}],"lore":{"intro":"Thumb pulling is treated as a low-cost add-on to mewing, with members divided on whether it does anything [1][2][8].","claims":[{"claim":"Thumb pulling can widen the palate or advance the maxilla","verdict":"unknown","note":""},{"claim":"It only works before about 15 or 16","verdict":"unknown","note":""},{"claim":"A thumb cannot generate enough force to matter","verdict":"unknown","note":""},{"claim":"Thumb pulling can create a diastema or other tooth changes","verdict":"unknown","note":""}]},"timeline":[],"refs":[{"title":"Thumb pulling update","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/thumb-pulling-update.1474237/","source":"looksmax.org","year":null,"type":"forum"},{"title":"Thumb Pulling Works Or is it bs?","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/thumb-pulling-works-or-is-it-bs.1410346/","source":"looksmax.org","year":null,"type":"forum"},{"title":"Palatal expansion","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Palatal_expansion","source":"Wikipedia","year":2026,"type":"encyclopedia"},{"title":"Where do I put my thumb in the palate during thumb pulling","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/where-do-i-put-my-thumb-in-the-palate-during-thumb-pulling.1226951/","source":"looksmax.org","year":null,"type":"forum"},{"title":"Underbite thumb pulling","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/underbite-thumb-pulling.1198054/","source":"looksmax.org","year":null,"type":"forum"},{"title":"Thumb pulling and maxilla growth","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/thumb-pulling-and-maxilla-growth.938667/","source":"looksmax.org","year":null,"type":"forum"},{"title":"Can a facepuller do mewing/thumb pulling for me","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/can-a-facepuller-do-mewing-thumb-pulling-for-me.593251/","source":"looksmax.org","year":null,"type":"forum"},{"title":"Thumb pulling","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/thumb-pulling.1230164/","source":"looksmax.org","year":null,"type":"forum"},{"title":"3 months thumb pulling no progress","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/3-months-thumb-pulling-no-progress.617073/","source":"looksmax.org","year":null,"type":"forum"},{"title":"Nose getting straighter from chewing and thumb pulling","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/nose-getting-straighter-from-chewing-and-thumb-pulling-pictures-provided.529814/","source":"looksmax.org","year":null,"type":"forum"}],"studies":[{"title":"Palatal expansion","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Palatal_expansion","source":"Wikipedia","year":2026,"kind":null}],"reddit":[],"forums":[{"title":"Thumb pulling update","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/thumb-pulling-update.1474237/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20250812125235/https://looksmax.org/threads/thumb-pulling-update.1474237/"},{"title":"Thumb Pulling Works Or is it bs?","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/thumb-pulling-works-or-is-it-bs.1410346/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20250613223001/https://looksmax.org/threads/thumb-pulling-works-or-is-it-bs.1410346/"},{"title":"Thumb pulling","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/thumb-pulling.1230164/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20241204032446/https://looksmax.org/threads/thumb-pulling.1230164/"},{"title":"thumb pulling slight underbite","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/thumb-pulling-slight-underbite.1140845/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://w